Title: Voter Portal

URL Source: https://sfelections.gov/voterportal

Final URL: https://sfelections.org/tools/portal/

Markdown Content:
Welcome to the Voter Portal!

Log in to review your voter record, check your party preference, and track your vote-by-mail ballot. You can also stop the mailing of your Voter Information Pamphlet, update your language preference for election materials, view your voting districts, and more.

To begin, enter your house number, zip code, and date of birth, and press Submit.

To provide feedback about the Voter Portal, please use our [contact form](https://sfelections.org/sfvote).

![Image 1: SF Department of Elections logo](https://sfelections.org/tools/portal/img/logo.png)

